    { "id": "research-06", "category": "research", "triggers": ["random", "success"], "text": "跑通只是起点，公平基线和重复种子才算站稳。" },
    { "id": "research-07", "category": "research", "triggers": ["random", "failure"], "text": "负结果别藏，它可能正好指出机制不成立的边界。" },
