    { "id": "simulation-01", "category": "simulation", "triggers": ["random", "start", "running"], "text": "先做小规模固定种子试跑，过门槛再扩矩阵。" },
    { "id": "simulation-02", "category": "simulation", "triggers": ["random", "thinking"], "text": "模型假设不写清，曲线再顺也像在梦里跑。" },
    { "id": "simulation-03", "category": "simulation", "triggers": ["random", "reviewing"], "text": "看均值，也看尾部、失败率和最坏情形。" },
